cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template, please cite it as below."
title: "overleaf-template: A LaTeX manuscript template for empirical business research"
abstract: "A LaTeX manuscript template demonstrating the table and figure outputs of project-template, configured for use with Overleaf for real-time multi-author editing. Includes biblatex-chicago citations, hypothesis-numbering conventions, and a section structure suitable for academic journals."
authors:
